    <sys:String x:Key="Create">Maok 'n kèllenderpunt aon</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Helpcreate1">• Klik op 'Nieuw item' in de wèrkbalk van de kèllender.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Helpcreate2">• Selecteer de medewèrker as ge toestemming het om 'n aandere medewèrker te beheren.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Helpcreate3">• Selecteer de datum.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Helpcreate4">• Selecteer de gewenste kèllenderstatus.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Helpcreate5">• Selecteer as 't nodig is 'n herhalingsoptie.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Helpcreate6">• Vul eventuele opmerkingen in.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Helpcreate7">• Klik op Opslaon.</sys:String>
